#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0288 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "TSVCDREF=CDISC + TSVCDVER=2024-09-27 on an SDTMIG run resolve the CT package sdtmct-2024-09-27, whose Term CCODE set holds the row's TSVALCD C49488 -> a valid code, no violation. The second row names a sponsor dictionary (TSVCDREF=MEDDRA), which the prefix(TSVCDREF, 5) == CDISC guard leaves alone. $VALID_TERM_CODES is a compiled binding over the get_codelist_attributes FUNCTION (wave 0, PLAN-binding-expressions: the operation was ported and deleted)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#library codelist-attributes sdtmct-2024-09-27 "Term CCODE" C49488 C66731
dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
col TSVCDREF type=Char
col TSVCDVER type=Char
col TSVALCD  type=Char
---
S1 | TS | 1 | SPECIES | HUMAN        | CDISC  | 2024-09-27 | C49488
S1 | TS | 2 | INDIC   | HYPERTENSION | MEDDRA | 25.0       | 10020772
